8, *const PdSyscalls)),\n    38\t    /// Load and prepare but do not invoke the entry point.\n    39\t    DryRun,\n    40\t}\n    41\t\n    42\tunsafe fn noop_jump(_entry: *const u8, _syscalls: *const PdSyscalls) {}\n    43\t\n    44\t/// Open a PDB by FAT 8.3 filename, copy it into `pdb_buf`, and jump to it\n    45\t/// according to `mode`.\n    46\t///\n    47\t/// Each stage of the launch path emits a `LAUNCH:<stage>` tag via\n    48\t/// `serial_write_bytes` so the host can observe how far the kernel\n    49\t/// progressed before a crash.\n    50\t///\n    51\t/// `pdb_buf` is temporary scratch that holds the on-disk `.pdb` bytes; `app_region`\n    52\t/// receives the relocated image. `syscalls` stays live for the duration of the jump.\n    53\tpub unsafe fn load_and_run<D: BlockDevice>(\n    54\t    fs: &mut FsState<D>,\n    55\t    filename: &[u8; 11],\n    56\t    pdb_buf: &mut [u8],\n    57\t    app_region: &mut [u8],\n    58\t    syscalls: &PdSyscalls,\n    59\t    mode: JumpMode,\n    60\t) -> Result<(), LoadAndRunError>\n    61\twhere\n    62\t    D::Error: core::fmt::Debug,\n    63\t{\n    64\t    serial_write_bytes(b\"LAUNCH:confirm\\n\");\n    65\t    serial_write_bytes(b\"LAUNCH:select\\n\");\n    66\t    let size = load_pdb(fs, filename, pdb_buf)?;\n    67\t    let jump_fn: unsafe fn(*const u8, *const PdSyscalls) = match mode {\n    68\t        JumpMode::Jump(f) => f,\n    69\t        JumpMode::DryRun => noop_jump,\n    70\t    };\n    71\t    unsafe { loader::load_and_run(&pdb_buf[..size], app_region, syscalls as *const _, jump_fn) }?;\n    72\t    Ok(())\n    73\t}\n    74\t\n    75\tfn load_pdb<D: BlockDevice>(\n    76\t    fs: &mut FsState<D>,\n    77\t    filename: &[u8; 11],\n    78\t    pdb_buf: &mut [u8],\n    79\t) -> Result<usize, LoadAndRunError>\n    80\twhere\n    81\t    D::Error: core::fmt::Debug,\n    82\t{\n    83\t    let mut name = [0u8; 13];\n    84\t    let len = format_app_name(filename, &mut name);\n    85\t    let path = core::str::from_utf8(&name[..len]).map_err(|_| StorageError::InvalidFormat)?;\n    86\t\n    87\t    let stat = fs.fs_stat(path)?;\n    88\t    serial_write_bytes(b\"LAUNCH:stat\\n\");\n    89\t    let size = stat.size as usize;\n    90\t    if size > pdb_buf.len() {\n    91\t        return Err(LoadAndRunError::FileTooLarge {\n    92\t            size,\n    93\t            capacity: pdb_buf.len(),\n    94\t        });\n    95\t    }\n    96\t\n    97\t    let handle = fs.fs_open(path, false)?;\n    98\t    serial_write_bytes(b\"LAUNCH:open\\n\");\n    99\t    let result = (|| {\n   100\t        let mut read = 0usize;\n   101\t        while read < size {\n   102\t            let n = fs.fs_read(handle, &mut pdb_buf[read..size])?;\n   103\t            if n == 0 {\n   104\t                return Err(LoadAndRunError::ShortRead {\n   105\t                    expected: size,\n   106\t                    read,\n   107\t                });\n   108\t            }\n   109\t            read += n;\n   110\t        }\n   111\t        serial_write_bytes(b\"LAUNCH:read\\n\");\n   112\t        Ok(read)\n   113\t    })();\n   114\t    let _ = fs.fs_close(handle);\n   115\t    result\n   116\t}\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019d544d-579a-76c0-a762-28c36384f38f","turnId":"019d544d-579c-7951-a98e-44ece7e079a5"}}
